{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如常可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦大悲咒，或三遍、七遍，隨意。次稱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡跪白言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心隨身口，一心頂禮。了知此身，如影不實。能禮所禮，心無所得。然後\n手擎香爐，胡跪請言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾同和云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下和準此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三請已，起禮三拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出家五眾，於諸天處，有請無跪拜。在家當禮，擎爐稱言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱畢，請言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論尊此當首請，而於光明會上，非對揚也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若後誦楞嚴呪，其呪有天龍八部之名，不可無請。當請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若不誦楞嚴呪，即不在請也。如上列名，一一三請大善。若其時速，可再加二總請，足前三請。請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二請畢，安座，白言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若出家者，隨戒稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若不誦楞嚴呪，應初誦大悲呪，灑淨畢，即請三寶諸天。今當誦十小呪，至功德天呪，\n須誦七遍，召請彼天及天眷屬等。如誦楞嚴呪及十呪，至天女呪，亦須誦七徧，以召彼天等。呪曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦已，祝延宣疏意，叩首起立，端身合掌，整心殷重，存想三寶諸天八部，畟塞虗空，應現道場，方伸供養也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜已伸白云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以手擎香華云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即以手散華，若不散，運想華從空下，復擎爐云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起立唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一體。此之香華偈，在前第二洒淨道場法，下誦亦得。\n次供齋。經云：早起諸天食。今以寅卯二時當供，若冬季辰初猶應供。供已讚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若不念佛發願迴向，即念供佛齋天殊勝行偈，三自歸畢。如欲念者，當如下作。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先誦金光明經讚，佛偈云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚已，稱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨念多少，如常發願，迴向禮拜，三自歸畢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云德叉伽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "涅槃經云：大善見王而為上首。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T53n2121_p0001c15"}
